#: ../../conceptual/cmake-packages.rst:258
msgid "Using CMake presets"
msgstr "使用 CMake 预设"

#: ../../conceptual/cmake-packages.rst:260
msgid ""
"CMake command lines depending on how specific users like to be when "
"compiling code can grow to unwieldy lengths. This is the primary reason "
"why projects tend to bake script snippets into their build definitions "
"controlling compiler warning levels, changing CMake defaults "
"(``CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE`` or ``BUILD_SHARED_LIBS`` just to name a few) and "
"all sorts anti-patterns, all in the name of convenience."
msgstr ""
"根据用户在编译代码时对细节的要求程度不同，CMake 命令行可能会变得冗长难管。 这"
"正是项目往往将脚本片段直接嵌入构建定义中的主要原因，这些片段用于控制编译器警"
"告级别、修改 CMake 默认设置（例如 `、CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE、` 或 `、"
"BUILD_SHARED_LIBS、` 等，仅举几例），以及各种反模式，而这一切都以“方便”为名。"

#: ../../conceptual/cmake-packages.rst:267
msgid ""
"Load on the command-line interface (CLI) starts immediately by selecting "
"a toolchain, the set of utilities used to compile programs. To ease some "
"of the toolchain related pains, CMake does consult the ``CC`` and ``CXX``"
" environmental variables when setting a default ``CMAKE_C[XX]_COMPILER`` "
"respectively, but that is just the tip of the iceberg. There's a fair "
"number of variables related to just the toolchain itself (typically "
"supplied using `toolchain files "
"<https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-toolchains.7.html>`_ ),"
" and then we still haven't talked about user preference or project-"
"specific options."
msgstr ""
"在命令行界面（CLI）中，工作流程从选择工具链（即用于编译程序的一组实用工具）开"
"始。为了缓解部分与工具链相关的问题，CMake在设置默认值时确实会参考环境变"
"量``CC `` 和 ``CXX ``，分别用于设置``CMAKE_C[XX]_COMPILER ``，但这仅仅是冰山"
"一角。 仅与工具链本身相关的变量就相当多（通常通过 ` 工具链文件 <https://"
"cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-toolchains.7.html> `_ 提供），而我们"
"尚未提及用户偏好或项目特定选项。"

#: ../../conceptual/cmake-packages.rst:277
msgid ""
"IDEs supporting CMake (Visual Studio, Visual Studio Code, CLion, etc.) "
"all came up with their own way to register command-line fragments of "
"different purpose in a setup-and-forget fashion for quick assembly using "
"graphical front-ends. This is all nice, but configurations aren't "
"portable, nor can they be reused in Continuous Integration (CI) "
"pipelines. CMake has condensed existing practice into a portable JSON "
"format that works in all IDEs and can be invoked from any command line. "
"This is `CMake Presets <https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-"
"presets.7.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"支持 CMake 的集成开发环境（如 Visual Studio、Visual Studio Code、CLion 等）都"
"各自开发了独特的方法，能够以“设置一次，无需再管”的方式注册不同用途的命令行片"
"段，从而通过图形化前端快速进行构建。 这固然很好，但这些配置既不具备可移植性，"
"也无法在持续集成（CI）管道中复用。CMake已将现有实践浓缩为一种可移植的JSON格式"
"，该格式可在所有IDE中运行，并支持通过任意命令行调用。相关链接如下：` CMake预"
"设 <https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-presets.7.html> `_。"

#: ../../conceptual/cmake-packages.rst:286
msgid ""
"There are two types of preset files: one supplied by the project, called "
"``CMakePresets.json`` which is meant to be committed to version control, "
"typically used to drive CI; and one meant for the user to provide, called"
" ``CMakeUserPresets.json``, typically used to house user preference and "
"adapting the build to the user's environment. These JSON files are "
"allowed to include other JSON files and the user presets always "
"implicitly includes the non-user variant."
msgstr ""
"预设文件有两种类型：一种由项目提供，名为``CMakePresets.json ``，该文件旨在提"
"交至版本控制系统，通常用于驱动持续集成（CI）；另一种由用户提供，名"
"为``CMakeUserPresets.json ``，通常用于存储用户偏好设置，并根据用户环境调整构"
"建配置。 这些 JSON 文件允许包含其他 JSON 文件，且用户预设始终隐式包含非用户版"
"本。"

