#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:8
msgid "ROCm Linux Filesystem Hierarchy Standard reorganization"
msgstr "ROCm Linux 文件系统层次结构标准的重组"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:10
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:12
msgid ""
"The ROCm Software has adopted the Linux Filesystem Hierarchy Standard "
"(FHS) "
"[https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html](https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html)"
" in order to to ensure ROCm is consistent with standard open source "
"conventions. The following sections specify how current and future "
"releases of ROCm adhere to FHS, how the previous ROCm file system is "
"supported, and how improved versioning specifications are applied to "
"ROCm."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 软件采用了 Linux 文件系统层次结构标准 (FHS) [https://"
"refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html](https://"
"refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html)，以确保 ROCm 符合标准的"
"开源规范。 以下各节说明了 ROCm 的当前及未来版本如何遵循 FHS、如何支持之前的 "
"ROCm 文件系统，以及如何将改进的版本规范应用于 ROCm。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:14
msgid "Adopting the FHS"
msgstr "采用FHS"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:16
msgid ""
"In order to standardize ROCm directory structure and directory content "
"layout ROCm has adopted the "
"[FHS](https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html), "
"adhering to open source conventions for Linux-based distribution. FHS "
"ensures internal consistency within the ROCm stack, as well as external "
"consistency with other systems and distributions. The ROCm proposed file "
"structure is outlined below:"
msgstr ""
"为了规范 ROCm 的目录结构和目录内容布局，ROCm 采用了 [FHS](https://"
"refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html)，遵循基于 Linux 的发行版"
"的开源惯例。 FHS 确保了 ROCm 堆栈内部的一致性，同时也保证了与其他系统及发行版"
"之间的外部一致性。ROCm 建议的文件结构概述如下："

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:54
msgid "Changes from earlier ROCm versions"
msgstr "与早期 ROCm 版本的差异"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:56
msgid ""
"The following table provides a brief overview of the new ROCm FHS layout,"
" compared to the layout of earlier ROCm versions. Note that /opt/ is used"
" to denote the default rocm-installation-path and should be replaced in "
"case of a non-standard installation location of the ROCm distribution."
msgstr ""
"下表简要概述了新版 ROCm FHS 布局，并与早期 ROCm 版本的布局进行了对比。请注意"
"，/opt/ 用于表示默认的 rocm 安装路径，如果 ROCm 发行版的安装位置非标准，则应"
"将其替换。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:83
msgid "ROCm FHS reorganization: backward compatibility"
msgstr "ROCm FHS 重组：向后兼容性"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:85
msgid ""
"The FHS file organization for ROCm was first introduced in the release of"
" ROCm 5.2 . Backward compatibility was implemented to make sure users "
"could still run their ROCm applications while transitioning to the new "
"FHS. ROCm has moved header files and libraries to their new locations as "
"indicated in the above structure, and included symbolic-links and wrapper"
" header files in their old location for backward compatibility. The "
"following sections detail ROCm backward compatibility implementation for "
"wrapper header files, executable files, library files and CMake config "
"files."
msgstr ""
"ROCm 的 FHS 文件组织结构首次出现在 ROCm 5.2 版本中。为了确保用户在过渡到新的 "
"FHS 结构时仍能运行其 ROCm 应用程序，我们实现了向后兼容性。 ROCm 已将头文件和"
"库文件移至上述结构所示的新位置，并在旧位置保留了符号链接和包装头文件以保持向"
"后兼容性。以下各节详细介绍了 ROCm 在包装头文件、可执行文件、库文件和 CMake 配"
"置文件方面的向后兼容性实现方案。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:87
msgid "Wrapper header files"
msgstr "封装头文件"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:89
msgid ""
"Wrapper header files are placed in the old location ( "
"`/opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/include`) with a warning message to include "
"files from the new location (`/opt/rocm-<ver>/include`) as shown in the "
"example below."
msgstr ""
"包装器头文件仍保存在原位置（` /opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/include `），并附有"
"提示信息，建议从新位置（` /opt/rocm-<ver>/include `）包含文件，如下例所示。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:98
msgid ""
"Starting at ROCm 5.2 release, the deprecation for backward compatibility "
"wrapper header files is: `#pragma` message announcing `#warning`."
msgstr ""
"从 ROCm 5.2 版本开始，针对向后兼容性封装头文件的弃用提示如下：` #pragma ` 发"
"布公告 ` #warning `。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:99
msgid ""
"Starting from ROCm 6.0 (tentatively) backward compatibility for wrapper "
"header files will be removed, and the `#pragma` message will be "
"announcing `#error`."
msgstr ""
"从 ROCm 6.0 开始（暂定），将取消对包装头文件的向后兼容性，且 ` #pragma ` 消息"
"将改为 ` #error `。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:101
msgid "Executable files"
msgstr "可执行文件"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:103
msgid ""
"Executable files are available in the `/opt/rocm-<ver>/bin` folder. For "
"backward compatibility, the old library location "
"(`/opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/bin`) has a soft link to the library at the"
" new location. Soft links will be removed in a future release, "
"tentatively ROCm v6.0."
msgstr ""
"可执行文件位于 ` /opt/rocm-<ver>/bin ` 文件夹中。为了向后兼容，旧的库位置"
"（` /opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/bin `）已设置了一个指向新位置库的软链接。 这"
"些软链接将在未来的版本中移除，暂定为 ROCm v6.0。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:113
msgid "Library files"
msgstr "库文件"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:115
msgid ""
"Library files are available in the `/opt/rocm-<ver>/lib` folder. For "
"backward compatibility, the old library location "
"(`/opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/lib`) has a soft link to the library at the"
" new location. Soft links will be removed in a future release, "
"tentatively ROCm v6.0."
msgstr ""
"库文件位于 ` /opt/rocm-<ver>/lib ` 文件夹中。为了向后兼容，旧的库位置（` /"
"opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/lib `）已设置了一个软链接，指向新位置的库。 这些软"
"链接将在未来的版本中移除，暂定为 ROCm v6.0。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:126
msgid "CMake config files"
msgstr "CMake 配置文件"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:128
msgid ""
"All CMake configuration files are available in the "
"`/opt/rocm-<ver>/lib/cmake/<component>` folder. For backward "
"compatibility, the old CMake locations "
"(`/opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/lib/cmake`) consist of a soft link to the "
"new CMake config. Soft links will be removed in a future release, "
"tentatively ROCm v6.0."
msgstr ""
"所有 CMake 配置文件均位于 ` /opt/rocm-<ver>/lib/cmake/<component>` 文件夹中"
"。 为保持向后兼容性，旧版 CMake 位置（` /opt/rocm-<ver>/<component>/lib/"
"cmake `）已设置为指向新 CMake 配置的软链接。这些软链接将在未来的版本中移除，"
"暂定为 ROCm v6.0。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:139
msgid "Changes required in applications using ROCm"
msgstr "使用 ROCm 的应用程序所需进行的更改"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:141
msgid ""
"Applications using ROCm are advised to use the new file paths. As the old"
" files will be deprecated in a future release. Applications have to make "
"sure to include correct header file and use correct search paths."
msgstr ""
"建议使用 ROCm 的应用程序采用新的文件路径。因为旧文件将在未来的版本中被废弃。"
"应用程序必须确保包含正确的头文件并使用正确的搜索路径。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:145
msgid ""
"`#include<header_file.h>` needs to be changed to `#include "
"<component/header_file.h>`"
msgstr "` #include<header_file.h> ` 需要改为 ` #include <component/header_file.h> `"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:148
msgid "For example: `#include <hip.h>` needs to change to `#include <hip/hip.h>`"
msgstr "例如：` #include <hip.h> ` 需要修改为 ` #include <hip/hip.h> `"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:151
msgid ""
"Any variable in CMake or Makefiles pointing to component folder needs to "
"changed."
msgstr "CMake 或 Makefile 中所有指向组件文件夹的变量都需要进行修改。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:154
msgid ""
"For example: `VAR1=/opt/rocm/hip` needs to be changed to `VAR1=/opt/rocm`"
" `VAR2=/opt/rocm/hsa` needs to be changed to `VAR2=/opt/rocm`"
msgstr ""
"例如：` VAR1=/opt/rocm/hip ` 需修改为 ` VAR1=/opt/rocm ` ` VAR2=/opt/rocm/"
"hsa ` 需修改为 ` VAR2=/opt/rocm `"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:157
msgid ""
"Any reference to `/opt/rocm/<component>/bin` or "
"`/opt/rocm/<component>/lib` needs to be changed to `/opt/rocm/bin` and "
"`/opt/rocm/lib/`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"任何指向 ` /opt/rocm/<component>/bin ` 或 ` /opt/rocm/<component>/lib ` 的引"
"用，均需分别更改为 ` /opt/rocm/bin ` 和 ` /opt/rocm/lib/ `。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:160
msgid "Changes in versioning specifications"
msgstr "版本规范的变更"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:162
msgid ""
"In order to better manage ROCm dependencies specification and allow "
"smoother releases of ROCm while avoiding dependency conflicts, ROCm "
"software shall adhere to the following scheme when numbering and "
"incrementing ROCm files versions:"
msgstr ""
"为了更好地管理 ROCm 的依赖项规范，确保 ROCm 能更顺畅地发布，同时避免依赖项冲"
"突，ROCm 软件在对 ROCm 文件版本进行编号和递增时，应遵循以下方案："

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:164
msgid "rocm-\\<ver\\>, where \\<ver\\> = \\<x.y.z\\>"
msgstr "rocm-\\<ver\\>，其中 \\<ver\\> = \\<x.y.z\\>"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:166
msgid "x.y.z denote: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH"
msgstr "x.y.z 表示：主版本.次版本.补丁版本"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:168
msgid "z: PATCH - increment z when implementing backward compatible bug fixes."
msgstr "z: PATCH - 在实施向后兼容的错误修复时递增 z。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:170
msgid ""
"y: MINOR - increment y when implementing minor changes that add "
"functionality but are still backward compatible."
msgstr "y：次版本号——在实施仅增加功能但仍保持向后兼容性的次要更改时，递增 y 值。"

#: ../../conceptual/file-reorg.md:172
msgid ""
"x: MAJOR - increment x when implementing major changes that are not "
"backward compatible."
msgstr "x: MAJOR - 在实施不向后兼容的重大变更时，增加 x 的值。"

