"<https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocprofiler-sdk/en/latest/index.html> `_ "
"以及 ` ROCm Compute Profiler <https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/rocprofiler-"
"compute/en/latest/> `_。"

